g previous-manifest entries that the new tree lacks (when they still match their recorded hash) would keep the install an exact copy.\nEOF\ncat .redeye/findings.md | head -3; git status --short"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_016jauCbkEeUtJ8a1Ax2Qxh8":{"cwd":"/Users/nick/code/tiiny_router_hermes.review"}}}
