{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChFZyPhA6nChPH54JpPVn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found two problems and wrote them to `.redeye/findings.md`, most severe first. I didn't edit or commit anything. `npm test` passes (40 Node tests and 6 Python tests), and `test/test_register.py` passes when run by hand (3 tests).\n\n1. **`npm test` never runs the `register(ctx)` test.** The `test` script in `package.json:24` runs the Node suite and `test/test_installed_tree.py`, but not `test/test_register.py`. That file is the only test that checks the skill registration: that `register` adds the delegation backend and `tiiny-model-routing`, with a `SKILL.md` path inside the installed directory. The spec says `npm test` must run this check. As things stand, you could delete the `ctx.register_skill` call (`tiiny-router/__init__.py:575`) and `npm test` would still pass.\n\n2. **An upgrade leaves behind files the new version removed.** `src/install.ts:53-59` copies the new tree on top of the old one and writes a manifest listing only the new files. Anything the previous manifest listed that is no longer in the package stays in the installed directory. Neither the manifest check nor `doctor` looks at it, so the skill or a user can still run the old copy.\n\nEverything else I checked holds up against the spec and `AGENTS.md`:\n- **Install and uninstall:** both refuse a directory without our manifest, and install refuses local edits unless `--force` is given.\n- **Config:** it is changed only through `hermes config set`, and the `tiiny` provider settings match the block in `references/backend.md`.\n- **File lookups:** the backend, controller and route checker find each other relative to their own location only.\n- **Model swap:** the new Ornith model replaces the old one in the tier table and every doc that names it.\n- **Docs:** the few em dashes and arrows left are inside text the code prints, which the docs rule allows.\n- **`doctor`:** it has tests for each failure the spec lists."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1166,"cache_read_input_tokens":82333,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1166},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"609fc6c8-36c5-450f-93cd-7a50d2886c85","uuid":"bace2f84-f050-4654-a660-952f478f2242","timestamp":"2026-11-21T06:05:09.099Z","request_id":"req_011ChFZyPYivqiMzsVJ3tLLM"}
